.TH AHERALD 1
.SH NAME
aherald \- desktop notifications for coding agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aherald
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
aHerald delivers notifications for configured coding agents.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --console-setup
Interactively select user hook integrations and usage settings.
.TP
.B --resident
Start the notification service for the current user.
.TP
.B --status
Show the current resident status.
.TP
.B --quit
Request a graceful resident shutdown.
.TP
.B --unsetup
Preview removal of this installation's saved user hook bindings.
Add \fB--apply\fR to perform the removal.
.TP
.B --help
List all options.
.SH FILES
The system package uses XDG user configuration, data and state directories.
See /usr/share/doc/aherald/installation.md for setup and removal details.
